  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, tells of two men, Doug Noland and Bill Ferguson, who are said to have found a crashed flying saucer in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, in March 1948. According to Doug, as Michels retells it, the two of them went inside the craft. If true, it would mean ordinary people stood inside an alien vehicle."
